{"seq":38,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w01788"},"reason":"The question asked which American 'claimed in 1909' to have been first at the North Pole, but Frederick Cook, also American, announced in September 1909 that he had reached it in 1908, so two explorers fit. The wording now names Peary's own claim: 6 April 1909, with Matthew Henson and four Inuit.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Peary"},{"url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/cache/epub/18975/pg18975.txt"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which American polar explorer claimed in 1909 to have been the first person to reach the geographic North Pole?","new":"Which American polar explorer claimed to have reached the geographic North Pole on 6 April 1909, with Matthew Henson and four Inuit companions?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welcher amerikanische Polarforscher behauptete 1909, als erster Mensch den geographischen Nordpol erreicht zu haben?","new":"Welcher amerikanische Polarforscher behauptete, am 6. April 1909 mit Matthew Henson und vier Inuit-Begleitern den geographischen Nordpol erreicht zu haben?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какой американский полярный исследователь заявил в 1909 году, что первым достиг географического Северного полюса?","new":"Какой американский полярный исследователь заявил, что 6 апреля 1909 года достиг географического Северного полюса вместе с Мэтью Хенсоном и четырьмя спутниками-инуитами?"}],"hash":"234d90c148db","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"7e31fe2deb2b06a6f113f35345b7691c3e6d78756066b0b7fc9afe9218bab2c8"},
